title: Projector Grid
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aleksei
    family-names: Vlasov
repository-code: "https://github.com/zap-syr/projector-grid"
url: "https://projectorgrid.com"
abstract: >-
  Free, open-source desktop application for controlling and monitoring arrays of
  Panasonic network projectors — power, shutter, input, geometry and colour, plus
  live status monitoring — with OSC input and output for show-control systems.
  Runs on Windows and macOS.
keywords:
  - projector control
  - projection mapping
  - Panasonic
  - NTCONTROL
  - OSC
  - show control
  - AV
  - projector monitoring
